# This directory is the build context for the `android` image, and it is also
# where the Play build runs: it holds the gradle project, the gradle cache, the
# signed .aab/.apk, and (transiently) the cloned keystore and service-account
# key. The Dockerfile COPYs none of it — the repo is bind-mounted at /repo at
# run time — so shipping any of it to the daemon would be pure cost, and would
# put secrets in a build context for no reason.
*
!Dockerfile
